comments.body:
Donald Trump has done the world three great favors.

1) He convinced the world that our military is not nearly as powerful or forward thinking as most people thought; 

2) convinced the world that America is not at all a reliable ally and its promises and agreements cannot ever again be trusted; 

3) convinced countries with intelligent, forward looking leaders to redouble their efforts to reduce or eliminate their dependence on fossil fuels, and invest in wind and solar energy.
